<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuṭhentu pawl in Israel ram an rak uk laiah an ram sungah paam a rak tlung. Curuangah Judah ram Bethlehem khua ih a ummi mipa pakhat cu Moab ram ih um dingah a nupi le a fapa pahnih thawn an vung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cupa ih hmin cu Elimelek a si; a nupi cu Naomi a si ih an fapa pahnih hmin cu Mahlon le Chilion an si. Anmah cu Efrath hrin an si. Moab ramah cun an vung thleng ih an vung um. Moab ram ih an um lai ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elimelek cu a thi ih Naomi cu a fapa pahnih thawn an hmei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fapa pahnih cun Moab fala an ṭhit. Pakhat ih hmin cu Orpah a si ih a dang pakhat ih hmin cu Ruth a si. Cule cutawk ramsungih kum hra tluk an um hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahlon le Chilion an thi lala ih Naomi cu pasal lo le fapa loin amah pakhat lawnglawng a rung taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in amah ih minung pawl thluasuahnak a pek ih rawl an paṭhazet a si ti kha Moab ramih a um laiah Naomi in a thei.Curuangah a fapa le ih nupi pawl thawn Moab ram taanta dingah an tim an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Judah ramih kir dingah cun hmun khatah an pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain lamzinah Naomi cun, “Nan inn ah kir uhla nan nu-ih hnen veve ah vung um uh. Keimah le in thihsan zotu pawl parih nan ṭhat bangin Bawipa cu nan parah ṭha ve hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule pasal nei sal in hnangamte ih nunkhuasak sal thei dingah Pathian in thlawsuah lo pe hram seh,” tiah an hnenah a ti. Curuangah Naomi cun damte in va kir uh, tiah a hnam hai. Asinain a fapa ih nupi pahnih cu napi in an ṭap ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“In taanta hram hlah aw; na miphun hnenah kan lo thlun ko pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Naomi in, “Asilo, fanu le uh; nan kir tengteng a ṭul a si. Ziangah so ka hnenih feh cu nan duh? Nan pasal dingah fapa pawl ka nei nawn ding maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inn ah vung tlung uh; kei pasal nei sal dingah cun ka tar tuk zo. Cun ruahsannak a um lai, tiah ti tahrat in tuih zanah pasal nei in fapa pawl ka neih khalle,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />patling an si lai hlan lo nan pasal dingah nan hngak thei ding maw si? Pasal dang neih a lo dawntu ah an cang sawn lo ding maw? Fanu le uh, a cang thei lomi a si ti nan thei ko. Bawipa in mi vanduai ah i tuah ih nan hrangah hin ka riah a sia ngaingai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule ring zetin an ṭap sal thotho. Cun Orpah in a ni cu damte in tiah a hnamta ih a miphun hnenah a kir. Sikhalsehla Ruth cu kir loin a ni cu a kaih fetfet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Naomi in, “Ruth, na pasal unau ih nupi cu a miphun le a khawzing hnenah a kir zo. Nang khal amah thawn inn ah vung tlung aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Ruth cun, “Nangmah lo taanta ih kir ding cu i fial nawn hlah aw. Na hnenah ka feh ve hram pei. Na fehnak kipah ka feh ve ding; na umnak kipah ka um ve ding. Na miphun cu ka miphun a si ding ih na Pathian cu ka Pathian a si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thihnak ah ka thi ding ih cutawkah phum ka si ve ding. Nang le kei hi thihnak siar lo zianghman in in ṭhen hlah seh. Thu dang ruangah ṭhen dingih ka lung a kim pang a si ahcun Bawipa ih hremnak ṭihnungza cu ka parah thleng seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiih feh ve a tumtah zia cu Naomi in a hmuh tikah zianghman a ṭong nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An pahnih in an feh ih Bethlehem khua cu an thleng. An thlen thu an theih tikah khuasungmi pawl cu lungawi in an sa hiamhiam. Cule nunau pawl in, “Naomi kha maw na si?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Naomi in, “Naomi, tiah i ko nawn hlah uh. Marah, tiah i ko sawn uh; ziangahtile Ziangkimtithei Pathian in riahsiatpi tlak in i tuah zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hitawk ihsin ka rak feh laiah khan neinungzet le famkimzet tein ka rak feh; asinain atu-ah Bawipa in i hruai kir tikah ka lawngte in ka thleng a si. Hitiin Ziangkimtithei Bawipa in i hnong ih i tisiat tikah hin ziangah so nannih in, Naomi, tiah in kawh duh rero?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuticun Naomi cu a fapa ih nupi Moab nunau Ruth thawn Moab ram ihsin an ra kir ih barli fang an ah thok pekte-ah Bethlehem khua ah an ra thleng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naomi cun a thizomi a pasal Elimelek ih lam in sungkhat a nei ih cupa ih hmin cu Boaz a si. Boaz cu milian le upattlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ruth in Naomi hnenah, “Lo ah ka feh pei ih fang attu pawl ih hrelhmi fanglep ka va hawl pei. I zaangfahtu hnenah ka va feh pei ih ka va hawl pei,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Naomi cun, “Va feh awla va hawl he, ka fanu,” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Ruth cu lo ah a feh ih rawl ṭuantu pawl ih dunglam in a thlun ih fanglep cu a lak vivo. A fehnak cu Elimelek ih sungkhat Boaz ih lo a rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua a hung tlai deuh tikah Bethlehem ihsin amah Boaz cu a ra thleng. “ Bawipa cu nan hnenah um hram seh,” tiah rawl ṭuantu pawl cu cibai a buk. Cule annih in, “ Bawipa in lo thlawsuah hram seh,” tiah an sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz in a rawl ṭuantu pawl hotu, a hnen-umpa hnenah, “Khi nu khi khuilam fala so a si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hnen-umpa cun, “Naomi in Moab ram ihsin a rak tlunpimi nunau a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Zaangfah tein rawl ṭuantu pawl hi an dung ka thlun pei ih an hrelh mi fanglep ka lak hram pei,’ tiah i dil. Zingpit ihsin tutiang a ṭuan ih tubaite ah khan deu sungah a vung cawl a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz in Ruth hnenah cun, “Ka fanu, thu ka lo sim ding. Khui hmanah feh hlah aw; hi lo lawngah hin rawl cu hawl ko aw. Hinah um awla ka rawl khawmtu nunau pawl hnenah hin ṭuan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rawl an ahnak kha zoh awla, fang attu mipa pawl cu nangmah lo hnaihnok lo dingin ka tiam zo a si. Na ti a haal a si khalle mipa pawl ih an khai ciami thawl sungih ta kha rak in aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Ruth cu a hmai leilung dai in a kun ih Boaz hnenah cun, “Ziangah so kei miphun dang nunau hi hitlukin i zaangfah ih ka zawn i ruat?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Boaz in, “Na pasal a thih hnuah na ni parih na tuahmi hmuahhmuah a zatein mi in in sim thluh a si. Na nu le na pa le na suahnak ram na taantanak le na hmuh dah lomi le na theih dah lomi miphun hnenih na rat thu khal ka thei thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hitiih na tuah ruangah hin Bawipa in lo rul hram seh. A thla hnuai ih humhimnak na hawlmi Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in a laksawng cu famkim zetin lo pe hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Ruth in, “I zaangfahzet a si, bawipa. Na hnen-um pawl lakih pakhat tluk hman ka si lo naón awkam ṭhazet ih i biak ruangah ka hna i ngamter zo a si,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suncaw ei caan a si tikah Boaz in Ruth hnenah cun, “Ra awla sang hi ra ei ve aw; sabitti sungah ciah in ra ei aw,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Ruth cu fang attu pawl lakah cun a to ve ih Boaz cun vaikan a rak pek. Khop zetih a ei hnuah a hlahmi tla a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule fanglep hawl dingih a feh hnuah Boaz in a hnaṭuantu pawl cu, “Fangcang phal pawl lak khalah fang cu hawl ve ko seh, dawn hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fangteel sung ihsin malte zuk uhla a sar dingah taanta hrim uh. A kawk khal kawk hlah uh,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Ruth in lo sungah fanglep cu zanlam tiang a hawl ih a ngah mi hmuahhmuah cu a vuak ṭheh tikah han khat lai a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A fang phur in inn ah a tlung ih fang a khawmmi cu a ni hnenah cun a hmuh. Cule a suncaw hlahmi khal a ni hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Naomi in, “Tuihsun khuitawkah so fanglep na hawl? Zo ih lo ah so na ṭuan? A lo zaangfahtu pa cu Pathian in thlawsuahnak pe hram seh,” a ti. Cule Ruth in, “Boaz an timi pa ih lo ah ka ṭuan a si,” tiah Naomi cu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Naomi cun, “A nungmi parah siseh, a thi ciami par khal ah siseh, zaangfahnak a thlenter ringringtu Bawipa in Boaz cu thlawsuah hram seh,” a ti. Cule Ruth hnenah, “Boaz cu kan hrinpi, kan sungkhat ngaingai sokhaw a si. Kannih in kilkhawitu ding khal amah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ruth in, “A si ngai ding. ‘Rawl ṭuan kan ṭheh hlan lo cu ka hnaṭuantu pawl hnenah ra ṭuan ringring aw,’ i ti hngehnge,” tiah a ni cu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naomi in Ruth hnenah, “A si ko, ka fanu; midang loih na feh ahcun hmuhsuamnak tla na tong pang ding. Boaz lo ih nunau hnaṭuantu pawl hnenih na ṭuan cu a ṭha bik a si,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah Ruth cu Boaz ih hnaṭuantu pawl lakah hna a ṭuan ih barli fang le sangvut an ah ṭheh hlan lo fanglep cu a hawl. Cule a ni hnenah cun a um ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Naomi in Ruth hnenah, “Ka fanu, innpawn suak ding le nunkhuasak nuam dingin ka lo tawlrel sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na theih vekin, a nunau hnaṭuantu pawl thawn hna nan ṭuannak lo neitu Boaz cu kan sungkhat a si. Cule, ngaihnik, amah cu tuihzan ah fang ciilnak ah barli fang a thlir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah ti kholh awla, rimhmui tla hnih awla, na hnipuan ṭha bik hruk aw. Cule fang a thlirnak ahcun va feh aw; asinain a in a ei hlan cu cutawkih na um kha lo thei hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun a ih tikah a ihnak hmun kha hminsin aw. A ihthat tikah feh in a ke lam in puan kha ong awla a kiangah it ve aw. Cule amah in ziang tuah ding ti kha a lo sim ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Ruth in, “I sim vek in ka tuah thluh ding,” tiah Naomi cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Ruth cu Boaz ih fang thlirnak hmun ahcun a feh ih a ni ih simmi vek cun a tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Boaz cu a in a ei ih nuam huahhi in a um ih, barli fang tampi an retnak ah a feh ih a it. A ihthat tikah Ruth cu thawthaang lo tein Boaz hnenah cun a feh ih a ke khuhnak puan a hliip hnuah a kiangah cun a it ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zanṭim hrawngah Boaz cu a ṭhanghoi ih a siir a her tikah a ke kiang ih nunau pakhat a ih kha a hmu ih a mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz in, “Zoso na si?” tiah a sut. Ruth in, “Na siahhlawh nu Ruth ka si. Na sungte ngaingai ka si ih i tlentu ding na si. Na puan kilte i zawn hram aw,” tiah Ruth cun a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz cun, “Ruth, Pathian in thlawsuah lo pe hram seh. Na ni Naomi parih na tuahmi hnakin atu ih na tuahmi ihsin sungkhat duh awknak cu na langter sinsin. Milian siseh, mi farah siseh, tlangval deuh sawn pasal ah na hawl lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah zianghman phang hlah aw. Nunau ṭha na si hi khawsungmi hmuahhmuah khal in an thei thluh. Na duhmi hmuahhmuah ka lo tuah sak thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sungkhat ngaingai ka si cu a dikmi a si. Sikhalsehla kei hnakin a nai sawnmi, na sungkhat tlentu, mipa pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuihzan cu hitawk ah hin um ko awla thaizing ah cuih na sungkhat pa cun na hrangah sungkhat ih ṭuanvo a la duh maw duh lo ti cu kan hliahter ding. A lak duh a si ahcun a ṭha ko; a lak duh lo asile a nungmi Pathian hmin sal in ka lo kam: Na hrangah ṭuanvo cu keimah in ka lak ding. Khawvang tiang hitawk ah it ko aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah zinglam tiang a kiangah cun a it. Asinain a kiangah Ruth a it ti kha mi ih an theih ding cu Boaz in a duh lo ruangah Ruth cu khawvang hlanah a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Boaz in, “Na korfualpi kha phuak awla hitawk ah phah aw,” a ti. A ti vek cun Ruth in a korfualpi cu a phuak ih a phah. Boaz cun barli fang han hnih tluk a pek ih a phurhter. Cule Ruth cu inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inn a thlen tikah a ni Naomi cun, “Ka fanu, ziang na bang?” tiah a rak sut. Cutikah Ruth cun Boaz hnenih a hmuhmi le a theihmi hmuhhmuah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Cuih tlunah na lawngte ih kir ding cu a rem lo a ti ih barli fang hizat hi i ṭhen a si,” tiah Ruth in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Naomi cun, “Ka fanu, cuih thu a hliah awk hlan cu hnangam tein um ko aw. Hi thu cu tuihsun ah Boaz in a fianter ko ding, a um men lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawsung mi an tonkhawm awk ṭheunak khawsuah ah Boaz cu a feh ih a to. Boaz ih a rel mi Elimelek ih sungkhat pa cu cutawk lam ahcun a ra ih Boaz in a hmin in a ko ih, “Hinah ra to hnik,” tiah a ti. A ti vek cun a ra to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Boaz in khawsung upa pahra a ko ih, “Hinah ra to hrih uh,” a ti ih an ra to ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz in a sungkhat tlentu pa hnenah cun, “Naomi cu Moab ram ihsin a ra kir sal zo ih kan sungkhat a si mi, a pasal Elimelek ih lo cu atu-ah a zuar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lo sim duhmi cu, loram cu na tlen duh asile hi upa pawl theih hngan ahhin tlen-aw. Na tlen duh lo a si ahcun keimah i sim aw; ziangahtile hi loram tlen theinak dingah cun nangmah na hmaisa ih kei ka neta sawn a si,” tiah a ti. Cupa cun, “Ka tlen ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz in, “Cutiih Naomi hnen ihsin loram na tlen a si ahcun, loram cu mithi pa ih innsang kut sungih a um ringringnak dingah Moab mi leengleh nu Ruth cu na tlencih a ṭul ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah cupa cun, “Cuti a si ahcun loram cu tlen loin ka um sawn pei, ziangahtile ka ro hmuahhmuah ka sung thluh pang ding ti ka phang. Nangmah in tlen aw. Kei cu ka tlen lo sawn pei,” tiah Boaz cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Culai ahcun Israel ram sungah thilri le leiram an zuar ah siseh, an thleng awk tikah siseh, an thlunmi daan cu: a zuartu in a kedam a phuak ih a tlentu hnenah a pek daan a si. Cuticun an thuhla a cat ti langternak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Boaz hnenah, “Nangmah in tlen aw,” tiih a sungkhat pa ih a ti tikah a kedam a phuak ih Boaz a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Boaz in upa pawl le cutawkih a rami hmuahhmuah hnenah, “Elimelek le a fapa Chilion le Mahlon pawl ih thilri le leiram hmuahhmuah cu Naomi hnen ihsin ka tlen zo ih tuihsun ahhin nannih cu nan zatein thutheitu nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih tlunah a thi zomi Mahlon ih nupi, Moab nunau Ruth tla cu ka nupi ah a cang a si. Cuticun thilri le leiram cu mithi pa ih innsang sungah a um ding ih a miphun lak le a khawsungah a innsang pawl cu an tel ringring ding a si. Tuihsun ah nanmah hi thutheitu nan si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah upa pawl le a ra telmi pawl cun, “Asi, thutheitu kan si. Na innsang sungih a ra thleng dingmi hi nunau nu cu Jakob hrangih faate tampi a hringtu Rachel le Leah bangtuk ah Bawipa in tuah hram seh. Efrath hrin sungah milian si hram awla Bethlehem khua ah na hmin thang hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah le Tamar ih fapa Perez ih innsang bangtuk in hi nunau nu sungih sin Bawipa in a lo pek dingmi na faale pawl in na innsang cu mawiter hram hai seh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Boaz in Ruth cu a inn ah a tlunpi ih a nupi ah a cang. Bawipa in Ruth cu thluasuahnak a pek ih fa a vun ih fapa a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule khawsung nunau pawl in Naomi hnenah, “ Bawipa cu thangṭhat si ko seh. Nangmah a lo kilkhawitu dingah Bawipa in tuihsun ah tupa a lo pek zo. Israel ram sungah hi nauhakpa cu a hmin thang hram seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah cu nunnak thar a lo petu le na tar tikah a lo hnemtu si hram seh. Cule a thi zomi na fapa ih nupi Ruth cu a lo duhdawtu a si ih fapa pasarih hnakih miṭhahnem sawn a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naomi cun a kut in naute cu a cawi; a ṭaangah a pom ih naute kilkhawitu ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule naute cu an inn hnen nunau pawl in Obed tiah a hmin an sak ih, “Naomi in fapa a nei zo,” tiah an tomi poh an sim. Obed cu Jesse ih pa a rung si ih, Jesse cu David ih pa a rung si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi pawl hi Perez ihsin David tiang an cithlah awk daan a si. Perez in Hezron a hring; Hezron in Ram a hring;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ram in Amminadab a hring;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amminadab in Nashon a hring, Nashon in Salmon a hring;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Salmon in Boaz a hring; cun Boaz in Obed a hring;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Obed in Jesse a hring ih Jesse cu David ih pa a si.
  </para>
</usx>
